Z||000015||Haze_Performance||05-23-2001||04:29 PM||||I have Tom's kit on my '88. I've gotten tons of compliments while out driving. Even with the stock 55W lights, It illuminates the very dark roads I drive nicely. I would suggest if you buy a kit you should change the brights from 55W to 75W or 100W bulb.<P>Great work Tom.......  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">      </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><BR><I>If you want to add your Fiero to the collection, post or send me a photo. (Sent photos ONLY to: purplehazeracing@yahoo.com )</I><P><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||14
